WEBVTT

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:19.140
Jack…

00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:28.680
Long time no see, Yusei.

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:39.470
When I was looking at that moon, 
I had a feeling you would show up.

00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:42.180
How many years has it been?

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:44.070
Two years.

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:47.100
Two years...

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:53.400
You built a nice D-Wheel.  I'm impressed.

00:00:55.090 --> 00:00:58.980
It's because you rode off 
with the one I made before.

00:01:01.390 --> 00:01:04.490
A King never lets a chance pass by.

00:01:05.270 --> 00:01:06.960
Where is it now?

00:01:09.290 --> 00:01:11.980
It broke down by now, of course.

00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:14.690
Where's my card?

00:01:15.350 --> 00:01:17.640
Stardust Dragon?

00:01:21.730 --> 00:01:23.630
It was our dream.

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:26.260
Our?

00:01:26.860 --> 00:01:31.040
It was the dream of all my Satellite friends.

00:01:37.070 --> 00:01:39.930
You're still saying those childish things?

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:45.480
Now that I'm King, this card is 
useless to me.  You can have it back!

00:01:52.010 --> 00:01:55.290
What's wrong?  Put it in your deck.

00:02:00.810 --> 00:02:02.490
I'll get it back from you in a duel!

00:02:03.040 --> 00:02:06.030
That's also why you came, right?

00:02:07.880 --> 00:02:09.270
Fine.

00:02:10.110 --> 00:02:14.240
I'm going to enjoy having 
a Riding Duel against you!

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:44.250
No matter how far apart we 
are, we can’t be stopped

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:49.310
That’s deeply engraved into us

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:57.850
So don’t be afraid of getting hurt

00:03:00.220 --> 00:03:03.790
Break through even further

00:03:04.170 --> 00:03:09.350
While carrying your beliefs in your heart

00:03:10.780 --> 00:03:16.460
There’s always only one truth

00:03:16.620 --> 00:03:20.320
So feel the voice of your heart

00:03:21.560 --> 00:03:25.130
With your unwavering emotions,

00:03:25.570 --> 00:03:31.240
Seize the signs of tomorrow

00:04:00.720 --> 00:04:06.610
Destiny Duel!  Stardust 
Dragon Stands in the Way

00:04:16.300 --> 00:04:17.750
Look, Yusei!

00:04:19.860 --> 00:04:22.610
This is the skyline of Neo Domino City!

00:04:25.130 --> 00:04:27.190
Neo Domino City never sleeps.

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:30.630
It keeps on pulsating 
and continues to expand.

00:04:30.840 --> 00:04:35.280
This city is alive and 
continues to grow endlessly.

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:41.270
And from now on, I will continue 
to reign here as King!

00:04:41.950 --> 00:04:44.940
You can start to see it from here, Yusei.

00:04:45.860 --> 00:04:47.710
It's Duel Stadium!

00:04:57.160 --> 00:05:01.450
It spins!

00:05:01.470 --> 00:05:07.010
Neo Domino City gives rise to 
infinite power because it spins!

00:05:07.010 --> 00:05:09.600
Its name is “Moment.”

00:05:09.610 --> 00:05:19.030
Neo Domino City created Moment, the ultimate 
energy development system, and it keeps spinning.

00:05:19.080 --> 00:05:23.810
The rotational power led to a huge leap in the development of

00:05:23.810 --> 00:05:27.810
the Duel Disk, bringing the Solid Vision System to a whole new level!

00:05:27.810 --> 00:05:37.640
Without the grace of Moment, the 
development of mankind is not possible.

00:05:40.810 --> 00:05:42.120
Akutsu.

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:50.760
As always, I fully understand your love 
for Moment.  Please get to the point.

00:05:51.710 --> 00:05:53.700
I'm prepared.

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:59.080
Is what you have to say so important that 
you had to call us in the middle of the night?

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:02.880
Of course!  Please listen and watch.

00:06:02.890 --> 00:06:08.550
We at KaibaCorp's Moment Research Development Division, also known as

00:06:08.550 --> 00:06:14.550
MIDS, have finally completed the Neo Domino City Perfect Moment project!

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:22.160
So Neo Domino City now has the most powerful 
energy, which is also known as God's intelligence!

00:06:25.870 --> 00:06:30.290
For specifics, please look at 
the documents while I explain.

00:06:28.470 --> 00:06:30.110
Excuse me.

00:06:35.460 --> 00:06:36.820
What?

00:06:36.920 --> 00:06:38.640
Akutsu.

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:45.780
I apologize, but I must leave because 
there is a problem that I must deal with.

00:06:46.110 --> 00:06:49.250
I'm sorry, but I'm excusing myself.

00:06:50.190 --> 00:06:51.800
Understood.

00:06:54.230 --> 00:06:56.630
Why didn't you stop the King?

00:06:57.070 --> 00:07:01.190
If it's discovered that he has a connection with the people

00:07:01.190 --> 00:07:05.190
of Satellite, his glory that we built will crumble in an instant.

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:08.520
I'm sorry.  I did tell him that to try to stop

00:07:08.520 --> 00:07:11.520
him, but Master Atlas acts like this on perfect nights.

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:17.160
There is no need for excuses.

00:07:20.840 --> 00:07:23.700
Please remember what I said.

00:07:24.460 --> 00:07:26.250
I'm sorry.

00:07:42.450 --> 00:07:45.230
I've been waiting for you, Director.

00:07:52.290 --> 00:07:55.860
The King is at Duel Stadium?

00:07:56.460 --> 00:08:00.670
This Satellite person also drives a D-Wheel.

00:08:01.970 --> 00:08:05.430
A perfect night…

00:08:05.770 --> 00:08:08.200
Should I inform Security?

00:08:08.290 --> 00:08:09.470
No.

00:08:09.780 --> 00:08:12.110
Not yet.

00:08:21.370 --> 00:08:24.730
This is my battlefield, Yusei.

00:08:26.160 --> 00:08:32.630
It feels good to be chased.  It 
makes me feel that I'm the King.

00:08:33.100 --> 00:08:36.800
A King must always protect his status!

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:42.490
Defending is more difficult than attacking.

00:08:42.670 --> 00:08:47.280
However, I'm the King because 
I fulfill those obligations!

00:08:52.210 --> 00:09:00.890
You've already lost your chance to get 
Stardust back!  You made a foolish choice!

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:28.050
Now let's have some fun, though it's a 
little sad that there are no spectators.

00:09:29.270 --> 00:09:32.840
Duel mode on.  Autopilot standby.

00:09:33.810 --> 00:09:37.280
Duel mode on.  Autopilot standby.

00:09:53.380 --> 00:09:54.480
Duel!

00:10:00.690 --> 00:10:04.260
Challenger, you go first!

00:10:05.470 --> 00:10:06.650
My turn.

00:10:06.750 --> 00:10:09.920
I summon Quillbolt Hedgehog 
in defense position.

00:10:12.150 --> 00:10:15.370
I haven't seen that in awhile.

00:10:17.440 --> 00:10:18.700
My turn!

00:10:20.090 --> 00:10:22.390
I summon Mad Archfiend!

00:10:25.360 --> 00:10:29.420
Yusei, watch how the King duels in amazement!

00:10:29.420 --> 00:10:32.010
Destroy it!  Bone Splash!

00:10:34.850 --> 00:10:40.470
Now Mad Archfiend's monster 
effect!  You take piercing damage!

00:10:44.520 --> 00:10:49.400
Do you understand?  By preempting 
your actions, I protect myself.

00:10:49.570 --> 00:10:52.000
You probably thought that even if you have weak monsters, you

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:54.490
won't take damage as long as you put them in defense position.

00:10:54.620 --> 00:10:59.210
Those tiny seams eventually 
become large tears.

00:10:59.920 --> 00:11:03.650
You will never be able to reach Stardust!

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:05.960
You talk too much.

00:11:06.800 --> 00:11:09.330
Right off the bat, the 
pace belongs to the King.

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:17.280
He uses his words and voice as 
weapons to overwhelm the challenger.

00:11:18.260 --> 00:11:24.040
That boy will not be able to defeat the King.

00:11:30.140 --> 00:11:31.450
My turn!

00:11:31.550 --> 00:11:34.590
I summon the Tuner Monster Junk Synchron!

00:11:40.110 --> 00:11:41.950
He's initiating his plan.

00:11:42.370 --> 00:11:46.290
With Quillbolt Hedgehog's monster effect, when a Tuner

00:11:46.290 --> 00:11:51.290
Monster is on my field, I can Special Summon it from the graveyard.

00:11:52.630 --> 00:11:56.790
I knew you would that.  Now do your tuning!

00:11:57.840 --> 00:11:59.260
Here I go.

00:12:03.210 --> 00:12:06.760
Junk Synchron tunes Quillbolt Hedgehog!

00:12:08.340 --> 00:12:14.410
The stars come together to call forth a new 
power!  Become the path that lights the way!

00:12:14.850 --> 00:12:16.270
Synchro Summon!

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:19.280
Come, Junk Warrior!

00:12:20.860 --> 00:12:23.150
You brought it out much 
earlier than I expected!

00:12:23.360 --> 00:12:25.420
Overestimating yourself will lead 
to your self-destruction, Jack!

00:12:25.530 --> 00:12:28.990
Junk Warrior, attack Mad Archfiend!

00:12:29.320 --> 00:12:31.210
Scrap Fist!

00:12:37.080 --> 00:12:38.630
My turn!

00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:45.440
I summon Twin-Shield Defender 
in defense position!

00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:51.710
Then I set one card and end my turn!

00:12:53.720 --> 00:12:57.340
Why didn't he attack?  What 
can that facedown card be?

00:13:00.900 --> 00:13:04.440
Now it's your turn, Yusei!

00:13:05.120 --> 00:13:06.320
My turn.

00:13:06.560 --> 00:13:09.600
From my hand, I summon Speed Warrior!

00:13:12.380 --> 00:13:27.600
With Junk Warrior's monster effect, the attack points of Level

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:22.600
2-or-below monsters on my field are added to Junk Warrior's attack points.

00:13:23.440 --> 00:13:25.600
Power of Fellows!

00:13:28.380 --> 00:13:31.900
Your strategies haven't changed at all.

00:13:32.770 --> 00:13:33.820
Battle!

00:13:33.990 --> 00:13:36.410
With Speed Warrior's monster effect, its original

00:13:36.410 --> 00:13:40.410
attack points are doubled on the turn in which it is summoned!

00:13:40.800 --> 00:13:43.550
Break through!  Sonic Edge!

00:13:46.670 --> 00:13:49.630
It's Twin-Shield Defender's monster effect.

00:13:49.780 --> 00:13:54.040
When this card is destroyed in battle while it is in defense position,

00:13:54.040 --> 00:13:59.040
he attack points of one of your monsters is halved until the end of the turn.

00:13:59.960 --> 00:14:04.040
However, the monster you 
had as your shield is gone!

00:14:07.040 --> 00:14:08.960
I will attack without fear.

00:14:09.480 --> 00:14:12.790
Junk Warrior, attack the player directly!

00:14:13.470 --> 00:14:15.530
Scrap Fist!

00:14:21.630 --> 00:14:24.490
You're no good.

00:14:24.950 --> 00:14:26.190
What?

00:14:26.230 --> 00:14:29.080
You look calm on the surface, 
but you quickly get hotheaded.

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:32.700
That's the reason why you 
always lost against me!

00:14:32.740 --> 00:14:33.950
What?

00:14:34.390 --> 00:14:36.210
You are afraid of me!

00:14:36.210 --> 00:14:40.300
That's why you repeatedly become impatient and attack

00:14:40.300 --> 00:14:43.300
and don't realize that I've been playing you like a puppet!

00:14:43.300 --> 00:14:45.170
Play me like a puppet?

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:50.060
The requirements to use this have been met.

00:14:50.230 --> 00:14:53.380
I activate the Continuous Trap Spacegate!

00:15:14.800 --> 00:15:17.360
The requirements to use this have been met.

00:15:17.610 --> 00:15:20.710
I activate the Continuous Trap Spacegate!

00:15:28.410 --> 00:15:35.780
Stargate gains Gate Counters equal to the 
number of times your monsters battled this turn.

00:15:38.140 --> 00:15:44.240
You initiated battle twice.  Therefore, 
it gains two Gate Counters!

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:50.690
I set one card and end my turn.

00:15:54.410 --> 00:15:58.080
He lured me into attacking him directly.

00:16:00.250 --> 00:16:02.980
The pace is still with Atlas.

00:16:03.070 --> 00:16:07.060
That boy isn't bad, but the King has played him like

00:16:07.060 --> 00:16:11.060
a puppet from the start, so he still has much to learn.

00:16:19.950 --> 00:16:22.880
I sense it!  I sense it, Yusei!

00:16:22.880 --> 00:16:24.990
You're unsure of yourself!

00:16:28.060 --> 00:16:31.420
I pretend to be in trouble, but then with a

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:34.420
brilliant counterattack, I bring catharsis to the crowd!

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:36.580
That is how a King duels!

00:16:37.390 --> 00:16:39.290
You talk too much.

00:16:39.940 --> 00:16:44.850
While the chased is full of 
confidence, the chaser is nervous!

00:16:45.150 --> 00:16:50.660
Yusei!  Right now, you're the 
chaser and I'm the chased!

00:16:50.820 --> 00:16:52.660
My turn!

00:16:54.430 --> 00:16:55.410
Here it comes.

00:16:55.550 --> 00:16:57.580
I activate a Speed Spell!

00:16:57.650 --> 00:16:59.360
Speed Fusion!

00:16:59.670 --> 00:17:03.210
This card is a Speed 
Spell-specific fusion card.

00:17:03.340 --> 00:17:07.950
I can activate this when I have 
four or more Speed Counters.

00:17:08.330 --> 00:17:11.080
The cards I'm going to fuse are these cards.

00:17:12.000 --> 00:17:17.060
I Fusion Summon by fusing Big Piece 
Golem and Medium Piece Golem together.

00:17:19.370 --> 00:17:24.850
Come, my servant.  Multiple Piece Golem!

00:17:28.880 --> 00:17:33.310
Multiple Piece Golem, destroy Speed Warrior!

00:17:37.020 --> 00:17:39.950
I activate the trap card Defense Draw!

00:17:40.420 --> 00:17:44.300
When I take damage due to an attack by your monster,

00:17:44.300 --> 00:17:48.300
the battle damage becomes zero, and I get to draw one card.

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:54.100
I knew that would be your facedown card.  
You always improvise to avoid danger.

00:17:54.230 --> 00:18:00.060
However, since Speed Warrior is gone, 
Junk Warrior's attack points decrease.

00:18:00.730 --> 00:18:04.000
Now Yusei!  The time has come!

00:18:04.210 --> 00:18:06.670
I'll show you how a King duels!

00:18:07.060 --> 00:18:13.280
At the end of the Battle Phase in which Multiple Piece Golem battled, I can

00:18:13.280 --> 00:18:17.280
undo the fusion to Special Summon the Fusion-Material Monsters from the graveyard.

00:18:17.420 --> 00:18:21.000
Next up is Medium Piece 
Golem's monster effect.

00:18:21.360 --> 00:18:28.810
When Big Piece Golem is on my field, I can 
Special Summon a certain monster from my deck.

00:18:28.810 --> 00:18:32.560
That monster is Small Piece Golem!

00:18:39.750 --> 00:18:41.860
It's getting busy over there.

00:18:42.470 --> 00:18:46.760
I haven't Normal Summoned yet this turn.

00:18:47.170 --> 00:18:50.690
I summon the Tuner Monster Dark Resonator!

00:18:57.170 --> 00:19:02.520
Level 3 Dark Resonator tunes 
Level 5 Big Piece Golem!

00:19:06.900 --> 00:19:10.500
The pulse of the King now forms a line here!

00:19:10.540 --> 00:19:14.990
Witness the power of the rumbling 
heavens!  Synchro Summon!

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:17.210
My soul!

00:19:17.210 --> 00:19:20.730
Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:19:32.920 --> 00:19:35.160
Red Dragon Archfiend…

00:19:36.030 --> 00:19:42.550
Yusei, look at the figure of the ominous 
and beautiful Red Dragon Archfiend.

00:19:42.700 --> 00:19:45.060
However, this isn't the end.

00:19:45.940 --> 00:19:48.730
I've invited a special guest for tonight.

00:19:50.310 --> 00:19:52.340
I send Spacegate to the graveyard.

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:55.740
With Spacegate, I can Special Summon a monster whose

00:19:55.740 --> 00:19:58.740
Level is equal or less than the number of Gate Counters!

00:19:59.320 --> 00:20:03.070
I Special Summon the Tuner 
Monster Sinister Sprocket!

00:20:03.310 --> 00:20:05.740
This is a Level 1 monster.

00:20:05.910 --> 00:20:13.130
And I use this to tune Level 3 Small Piece 
Golem and Level 4 Medium Piece Golem.

00:20:16.410 --> 00:20:19.800
Witness the wings guided by a great wind!

00:20:19.890 --> 00:20:21.740
Synchro Summon!

00:20:21.970 --> 00:20:25.170
Roar, Stardust Dragon!

00:20:44.350 --> 00:20:46.200
Stardust…

00:20:50.650 --> 00:20:53.290
Director, this is…

00:20:53.340 --> 00:20:56.810
It's nothing to be surprised about.

00:20:57.040 --> 00:21:01.340
It's something that the King can do easily.

00:21:01.550 --> 00:21:07.150
Sagiri, even though you're always by the 
King's side, you know anything about him.

00:21:09.290 --> 00:21:11.480
Now...

00:21:12.050 --> 00:21:15.440
This is becoming fun, Director.

00:21:17.150 --> 00:21:19.660
Let's watch them.

00:21:30.870 --> 00:21:34.390
Everyone who needs to 
be here are now present!

00:21:34.460 --> 00:21:36.770
I've raised the curtain on this party.

00:21:36.990 --> 00:21:41.140
Let Act 1 begin!

00:22:04.490 --> 00:22:10.020
What can we grasp?  What can we do?

00:22:10.440 --> 00:22:15.450
We’ll step forward and find out

00:22:15.850 --> 00:22:21.390
My unstoppable emotions, the 
beating of my passionate heart

00:22:21.560 --> 00:22:26.630
I heard the voice of truth

00:22:26.830 --> 00:22:29.800
After I was hurt, I learned

00:22:32.370 --> 00:22:35.370
Of a place where I can become stronger

00:22:37.340 --> 00:22:42.540
I stack my dreams in my palm

00:22:42.680 --> 00:22:47.950
And I’ll someday pass them to you

00:22:48.380 --> 00:22:53.890
Seeking for the signal 
to start, my soul roars

00:22:54.190 --> 00:22:59.130
I will overcome my suffocating 
and mediocre life

00:22:59.760 --> 00:23:05.270
I’ll dash and acquire 
all the bright futures

00:23:05.430 --> 00:23:14.680
Carrying the bonds I believe 
in, I run towards tomorrow
